00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,480
exact same discipline.

5
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:21,660
Yeah, absolutely. I mean, a city half-built is essentially an expensive ghost town,

6
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,940
and the digital equivalent is honestly just as costly.

7
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:33,100
You end up with these, you know, fragmented, siloed systems where data is constantly being rekeyed and efforts are endlessly duplicated.

8
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:40,020
