00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:59,800
It really is. And we'll be using the demonstration country Progressa and the POA framework, that's the Public Administration Ecosystem Reference Architecture,

12
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,240
as our models today.

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:11,560
So whether you are managing an ecosystem of services in your ministry or trying to align a massive multi-year budget, we are unpacking how you actually structure a

