00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:29,300
Okay, what does inception actually entail?

18
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:34,180
Well, this is where you establish your repository and an enterprise architecture board to actually govern the rules.

19
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:37,680
And crucially, this is also when the learner register becomes authoritative.

20
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:43,180
Let's pause and define what that means in practice because, you know, authoritative is kind of a heavy architectural term.

